        "TileImage": "$($repository 9833e86e-7aba-4a32-9096-f02e73b9e554).Image",
        "Description": "James Bordon, codename A-wut, a ICA ex-operative. Our files show that he was an exceptional agent - most of our rare intelligence is from his missions. Last year, he had gone rouge. He is currently disguised as a security official of a Bangkok hotel for one of his missions. Eliminate this threat cleanly.\r\rAdditionally, the ICA wants his insider person, Prawta Buaborn, to be terminated. Our records show that she is assigned to floor two, so we have booked a room there for you.",
